      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. NUMBER SYSTEM – BASIC CONCEPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Number System is the fundamental building block for Quantitative Aptitude in SSC exams.",
        "Types of numbers and their specific mathematical properties form the core concept of Part 1.",
        "Divisibility rules are given high priority as they are frequently tested in competitive questions.",
        "Understanding factors and multiples is crucial for solving practice questions efficiently."
      ],
      "id": "zehme69"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "26v5033",
      "content": "Number System deals with classification and properties of numbers used in calculations.<br></br><br></br>In SBIexamination, questions from Number System are:<br></br>• Basic<br></br>• Concept-based<br></br>• Usually one or two steps only"
    },
